nt ID<input id="client" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></label><button id="signin">Sign in to Microsoft</button></div><p>Commercial cloud endpoints only. Browser support, tenant policy and cross-origin access must be verified in your tenant. <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/admin/inventory-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft API documentation</a></p></details><p id="notice" class="note" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a scope and run a scan.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Inspection coverage</h2><p id="summary">No completed scan</p><div class="table-wrap" id="coverage"></div></section><section class="box"><h2>Findings with evidence</h2><p>Review items are prompts for investigation. Missing evidence is never treated as proof of health or inactivity.</p><div class="table-wrap" id="findings"></div></section><section class="box"><h2>Resource inventory</h2><label class="field">Search inventory<input id="filter" type="search"></label><p id="count"></p><div class="table-wrap" id="inventory"></div></section><section class="box"><h2>Reports and changes</h2><div class="stack"><button id="export" disabled>Save snapshot JSON</button><button id="csv" disabled>Export inventory CSV</button><button id="print" disabled>Print report / save PDF</button><label class="field">Compare a previous snapshot<input id="baseline" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label></div><div class="table-wrap" id="changes"></div></section><section class="box"><h2>Network transparency</h2><p>Processing occurs in this browser. No analytics, advertising, external scripts or AI services run in this web resource. Tokens and results remain in memory until you export them. Exports contain resource names and identifiers; review them before sharing.</p><p>Environment mode reads the current Dataverse API. Tenant mode contacts login.microsoftonline.com and api.powerplatform.com only after sign-in or scanning. Open Developer Tools → Network to inspect requests. Offline files support sample previews and downloaded reports; live inspection needs a network connection and authentication.</p><p>Connector inventory is preview and incomplete. Inventory modification dates do not indicate usage. Usage, failures, DLP compliance, licensing and complete effective security are not assessed.</p></section><footer>Platform Insights by Mightora · Public Beta · MIT licensed · Read only</footer></main><script id="insights-core">function cleanResource(r,source){
